msgid "Renode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/simulators/renode.rst:20
msgid ""
"Renode is a development framework which accelerates IoT and embedded systems "
"development by letting you simulate physical hardware systems - including "
"both the CPU, peripherals, sensors, environment and wired or wireless medium "
"between nodes. For more information, see `Renode's official website <https://"
"renode.io/?utm_source=platformio&utm_medium=docs>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/simulators/renode.rst:26
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/unit-testing/simulators/renode.rst:28
msgid ""
"Integration of the Renode requires adding the `platformio/tool-renode "
"<https://registry.platformio.org/tools/platformio/tool-renode>`_ package to "
"the :ref:`projectconf_env_platform_packages` option in your :ref:"
"`projectconf`, and overriding the :ref:`projectconf_test_testing_command`."
msgstr ""

